          "title": "Oh no! My servo isn't connecting!",
          "content": {
            "type": "Text",
            "format": "html",
            "text": [
              "<p>Are you having trouble connecting? Try these things:</p><ul><li>Click the lightening bolt icon at the top left of your Dataflow tile (in your workspace) and click spiker:bit, like this picture →</li></ul><p>If that doesn&#x27;t work, try these options. After each option, try connecting using the lightening bolt icon again!</p><ul><li>Make sure you&#x27;re in Google chrome (not Safari or another browser).</li><li>Turn the spiker:bit off and unplug it. Then, plug it back in and turn it on again.</li><li>Close the CLUE lesson and re-open it</li></ul><p>If all else fails, ask for help! Even engineers have connection problems sometimes!</p>"
            ]
          }
